  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bak Kan water supply and sanitation project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">VIET/Bak Kanin vesi- ja sanitaatiohanke</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Bac Kan&apos;in alueen vesi- ja sanitaatiohuollon kehitt&#xE4;minen. Hankkeen tarkoituksena on parantaa j&#xE4;tevesihuoltoa ja rakentaa jakeluverkko.
Vietnamin viranomaiset ovat pyyt&#xE4;neet Suomen hallitus arvioimaan Bac Kan&apos;in hankkeen, ja samalla suomalainen hankkeesta kiinnostunut viej&#xE4; on auttanut paikallisia tahoja kehitt&#xE4;m&#xE4;&#xE4;n hanketta sek&#xE4; tehnyt hankkeesta korkotukiluottohakemuksenVesi- ja sanitaatiohuollon kehitt&#xE4;minen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Bac Kan Water Supply and Sanitation Project is to: (i) increase the capacity of water supply by constructing a new surface water supply system from the river, (ii) improve the flooding situation by expanding and dredging of the river bed, and (iii) create a waste water collection and treatment system. The project will be implemented in two stages: The water supply target of the first stage by 2010 is 10 000 m3/day and the waste water treatment capacity 9 000m3/day. The supply target of the second stage is 16 000 m3/day in the year of 2020 and the respective waste water treatment capacity 18 000 m3/day. The proposed credit is meant for implementation of stage I.</narrative>
  </description>
